# ===========================================================================
# @apricotter/x-components 0.1.0, as npm published it: the tarball and its
# attestations, kept once from the registry so a build never reads the
# network. provenance.ttl is what the attestations say, derived from these two
# files by the step below and never written by hand; the step derives it again
# on every build and stops the build if the committed copy differs. The check
# then holds the kept bytes to the provenance, and the provenance to the
# commit the audited candidate came from. This is the x-components plan's
# keep step, and its check that the published tarball is signed and logged.
# ===========================================================================
<https://drift-king.org/vendor/npm/apricotter-x-components/0.1.0/x-components-0.1.0.tgz>
    a prov:Entity , p-plan:Entity ;
