    rdfs:comment "The release candidate the home page is built on. Not published and not taken." .

# A step that waits for a taking is held until a taking of its version is signed. The
# check is the query the builder asks, run on small graphs of its own: a step whose
# taking is not signed is found; a taking of another version leaves it found; a taking
# of its version, signed, leaves nothing.
<https://drift-king.org/the-builder/queries/untaken.rq>
    a dcat:Resource , p-plan:Entity , earl:TestCriterion ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://drift-king.org/ah/the-builder> ;
    dcterms:conformsTo <https://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-query/> ;
    dcterms:title "a step that waits for a version to be taken is held until a taking of that version is signed" ;
    p-plan:correspondsToVariable <https://drift-king.org/not-ah/the-linter/held-until-taken/var/rq> .
<https://drift-king.org/not-ah/the-linter/held-until-taken/var/rq> a p-plan:Variable .
